(text "07 | PTC heater and 24 V pump" (at 12.7 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9f091799-956a-5327-9550-41819c5821df"))
(text "PTC is ON/OFF only, no fast PWM. External independent thermal cut-out is required in series with heater.\nGPIO32 HIGH turns on Q701 NPN, Q702 PNP, then Q703 power MOSFET; LOW / Hi-Z turns it off.\nQ703 IRF1010ES pin 2 and metal tab = DRAIN, pin 3 = SOURCE, pin 1 = GATE.\nPump GPIO33 HIGH turns on Q704. 1k series gate uses the purchased spare resistor pack.\nD701 pump flyback cathode to fused +24V_PUMP, anode to PUMP_DRAIN.\n100k GPIO/gate pulls stay active during reset. Pump stall current and fuse coordination still unmeasured." (at 12.7 251 0) (effects (font (size 1.02 1.02)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4a832215-fa1f-5128-955a-88bc5ee25615"))
